================================================================================
Sources, Protocol Specifications, and Third-Party Notices
================================================================================

1. MAVLink Wire Protocol Specification (v1 & v2)
   - Source: https://mavlink.io/en/guide/serialization.html
   - Packet Signing Specification: https://mavlink.io/en/guide/message_signing.html
   - CRC_EXTRA Calculation Specification: https://mavlink.io/en/guide/crc.html
   - Relationship: This library is a clean-room native MoonBit implementation of
     the MAVLink v2 and v1 binary wire framing, X.25 CRC-16/MCRF4XX checksum,
     payload trailing-zero truncation, packet signing (SHA-256), and XML schema
     code generator.

2. Official MAVLink XML Message Definitions (`minimal.xml`, `common.xml`)
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink
   - Upstream Copyright: Copyright (c) 2009-2026 Lorenz Meier and MAVLink Contributors
   - Upstream License: MIT License (https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
   - Usage: Standard XML message definitions (`HEARTBEAT`, `SYS_STATUS`,
     `SYSTEM_TIME`, `PING`, `PARAM_REQUEST_READ`, `PARAM_VALUE`, `GPS_RAW_INT`,
     `ATTITUDE`, `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT`, `RC_CHANNELS_RAW`, `MISSION_ITEM_INT`,
     `COMMAND_LONG`, `COMMAND_ACK`, `STATUSTEXT`) and enum definitions are used
     as input schemas for the MoonBit code generator and protocol conformance
     test vectors.
